Title: TSM auction selection hook point (used by Meionomics price history)
Why: TSM's Browse and Sniper results have no public way to tell another addon which item is selected, so Meionomics can't show that item's price history beside TSM's window. Adds TSMLocalAuctionSelect.callbacks: each is called with the selected row's base item string (nil when nothing is selected) and TSM's window frame (nil when the results table is gone, e.g. tab switched).

=== FILE TradeSkillMaster\App\AuctionUI\AuctionBuyScan.lua
--- OLD
